            <div xml:id="d28">

                <pb facs="0122" n="20" xml:id="pg20"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">868.797/2: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Skinner</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-01-28T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 28,
                                1927—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>2. Your No. 2, January 25, 3 p.m. Please telegraph whether contemplated
                    concession constitutes simply exclusive franchise to operate motor bus system or
                    whether it grants rights so comprehensive as, for instance, to exclude
                    individual owners from operating motor taxi service.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
